We also need to handle the case where after arrival at station5, we may need to stop the process and maybe reset for next product. Possibly we need to reset state after sensor5 detection and maybe after some delay.

We also need to handle the start condition: sensor1 and station1Start must both be true to start. But also we might need to ensure that we only start when no other product is moving. So maybe we need a "busy" flag.

